{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Terminal Outbreak",
    "steam_appid": 3479820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1745862427\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Terminal Outbreak</i></strong> is a fast paced speed game where you are constantly accelerating forward and can only slow down and move left and right to avoid the obstacle filled levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on simple controls but hard levels and is focused on players achieving the best times they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Anti Virus on a mission to stop a Super Virus from infecting\u00a0computers worldwide. You will travel through\u00a0Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky  Levels, and Brutal Boss Fights in order to cleanse the internet of this Virus threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/5d10a4392fdd7031beb5eafe71832b84.avif?t=1745862427\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Levels of Fast Paced, Score Chasing, Speed Running Goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Computerized Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best Time Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Early 2000's Internet Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Obstacles, Launch Into the Air, Teleport Across Levels and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments that react and bounce to the Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Death Messages to announce your failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor Dating Sim Elements?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/0a301baf32e6208cbb97f5f88786c454.avif?t=1745862427\" data-has-big width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Terminal Outbreak</i></strong> is a fast paced speed game where you are constantly accelerating forward and can only slow down and move left and right to avoid the obstacle filled levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game thrives on simple controls but hard levels and is focused on players achieving the best times they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Anti Virus on a mission to stop a Super Virus from infecting\u00a0computers worldwide. You will travel through\u00a0Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky  Levels, and Brutal Boss Fights in order to cleanse the internet of this Virus threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/5d10a4392fdd7031beb5eafe71832b84.avif?t=1745862427\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Levels of Fast Paced, Score Chasing, Speed Running Goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Computerized Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best Time Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Early 2000's Internet Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge Obstacles, Launch Into the Air, Teleport Across Levels and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments that react and bounce to the Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Death Messages to announce your failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor Dating Sim Elements?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The only speed game where you want to slow down, as you infinitely accelerate and race to save the Internet from a Horrible Super Virus infecting computers worldwide! Launch, Crash, and Slam on the Breaks through Multiple Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky Levels, and Brutal Boss Fights.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
